cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CarlaGym: a Gymnasium environment for joint bandwidth allocation and routing in congested packet networks"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, pure-Python store-and-forward packet network simulator with a
  Gymnasium interface, in which an agent allocates per-link bandwidth under a
  budget and sets per-link routing weights. Ships with rule-based baselines, a
  fluid flow upper bound, and a reproducible evaluation protocol.
